Powershell colors:

```bash
function Get-OxideAuthStatus {
    $output = & oxide auth status

    foreach ($line in $output) {
        if ($line -match "(?i)error|invalid|missing|failed") {
            # Shades of red
            Write-Host $line -ForegroundColor Red
        }
        elseif ($line -match "(?i)authenticated|success") {
            # Shades of green
            Write-Host $line -ForegroundColor Green
        }
        else {
            # Default color for "Checking..." lines etc.
            Write-Host $line
        }
    }
}
```